  "qualifications": [
    "Chromium 156 has no MathMLMathElement interface; math is a MathMLElement there (NotExposed).",
    "A filter that re-enters its own traversal raises InvalidStateError on both engines; afterwards the engine leaves the NodeIterator referenceNode null. Reading it crashes the Chromium 156 renderer, so the browser run does not read it.",
    "The canonical tagInterfaces table has no MathML rows; the Views generator maps the math tag to MathMLMathElement itself.",
    "Unknown HTML elements wrap as HTMLElement natively (pre-existing, outside these groups).",
    "Native runs only on win-x64 slim Native26; other platforms and official packages are acceptance gates."
